# Mercenary Combat Suit Localization

uplink-mercenary-modsuit-name = Gallóglach Mercenary Combat Suit
uplink-mercenary-modsuit-desc = A complete combat suit system featuring advanced armor plating, integrated defensive systems, and combat-enhanced gloves and boots. The chestplate features an integrated energy shield powered by a micro reactor. Boots have advanced magboots. Provides excellent protection against ballistic threats and includes reactive armor plating. Named after the elite medieval Irish mercenary warriors.

uplink-mercenary-modsuit-gloves-name = Gallóglach Combat Gloves
uplink-mercenary-modsuit-gloves-desc = Reinforced combat gauntlets with integrated kinetic strike enhancers. Delivers devastating unarmed blows capable of shattering armor and structures. Significantly improves melee combat effectiveness and provides stamina protection.

uplink-mercenary-modsuit-boots-name = Gallóglach Combat Boots
uplink-mercenary-modsuit-boots-desc = Heavy-duty combat boots with integrated armor plating and advanced mag-lock systems. Provides excellent protection and no-slip grip.

ent-ClothingBackpackMercenaryModsuitControl = { ent-ClothingBackpackDuffel }
  .desc = A compact back-mounted control unit containing a full set of Gallóglach mercenary combat suit components. Designed for rapid deployment in hostile environments.
  .suffix = mercenary

ent-ClothingBackpackMercenaryModsuitControlSealed = { ent-ClothingBackpackMercenaryModsuitControl }
