ent-ClothingOuterModsuitMercenary = Gallóglach mercenary combat suit
  .desc = A heavy-duty combat suit with integrated defensive systems. Features advanced ballistic protection, reactive armor plating, and a toggleable energy barrier shield that projects a green outline around the wearer. Use in hand to activate the shield (drains battery from integrated micro reactor). Part of the Gallóglach combat suit system.
  .suffix = combat suit

